1 NAME Anna Maria Svensdatter /Tjora/
2 GIVN Anna Maria Svensdatter
2 SURN Tjora
2 _MARNM Stangeland
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 11 SEP 1851
2 PLAC Myklebust, Tananger, Haaland, Rogaland, Norway
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 3 JUL 1926
2 PLAC Sonoma, California, United States
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE 7 JUL 1926
2 PLAC Santa Barbara, CA, USA
