2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/108526145/erick-fristad
2 CONT
2 CONT Erick Fristad BIRTH	8 Dec 1888 Norway DEATH	17 Nov 1963 (aged 74) Rockford, Winnebago County, Illinois, USA BURIAL	 Cedar Bluff Cemetery Rockford, Winnebago County, Illinois, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Tuesday, November 19, 1963, Morning Star (Rockford, IL), pg. 21
2 CONT
2 CONT Erick Fristad, 74, River Bluff Nursing Home, died at 4:30 a.m. Sunday, Nov. 17, 1963, in the nursing home after a long illness. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born Dec. 8, 1888, in Norway. Lived several years in Rockford, coming here from Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include: a sister, Mrs. Anna Nordbo, Seattle, Wash.
2 CONT
2 CONT Services at 2:30 p.m. Wednesday, Nov. 20, in Julian-Poorman Funeral Home. Burial in Cedar Bluff Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription 74 yrs Gravesite Details Compiled by the Winnebago Genealogical Society
