1 NAME Halvard Samuelsen /Tunheim/
2 GIVN Halvard Samuelsen
2 _MARNM Tunheim
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 APR 1824
2 PLAC Tunheim
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 18 APR 1824
