2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT GEORGE PAUL SOLOVSKOY was born 15 Aug 1917 in Khabarovsk, Russia, to parents Paul Petrovich Solovskoy and Maria A. Kowalenko.
2 CONT
2 CONT He immigrated to the US and became a naturalized citizen 1 May 1940. He attended the University of Michigan at Ann Arbor.
2 CONT
2 CONT MILITARY: COLONEL US ARMY WWII and KOREA. He enlisted 22 Oct 1942 and was released 28 Feb 1961.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died 2 Jun 1991 in San Francisco, CA.
