2 CONT Samuel A. Hana BIRTH	2 Sep 1876 Stavanger, Stavanger kommune, Rogaland fylke, Norway DEATH	31 May 1962 (aged 85) Humboldt County, California, USA BURIAL	 Ocean View Cemetery Eureka, Humboldt County, California, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT SAMUEL A. HANA May 31, 1962 2434 Garland St.
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Albertina Hana. Father of Mrs. Selma Stone, Mrs. Edith Sicard of Fairfax, Mrs. Marie Edwards of Fallbrook. Brother of Helmik Hand, Mrs. Dorothia Hand, Mrs. Anna Aronson of Norway. He is survived by 3 grandchildren, 4 gr
2 CONC eat grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT A native of Stavanger, Norway, age 85.
2 CONT
2 CONT Services will be held at Cooper Mortuary, Chapel of the Ferns, Monday, June 4, 1962 at 1:30 p.m. with the Rev. James M. Brown officiating. Interment at Ocean View Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Published in the Eureka Humboldt Standard on June 2, 1962
