2 CONC 5/11 1781gift m/Guri..... Nemnd som prestens medhjelpar. </p><p>&nbsp</p><p>AndersAsbjørnsen was the first man who himself owned this 21-barrels farm. He got hisfirst deed (7 barrels) and the remainder deed (14 barrels) in 1788. H
